<title>USA: U.S. Robotics unveils terminal adapter.</title>
<headline>U.S. Robotics unveils terminal adapter.</headline>
<dateline>SKOKIE, Ill. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Robotics on Monday unveiled its new DataBurst terminal adapter, which provides a a faster data transfer rate to a computer.</p>
<p>The adapter enables users to reach the full potential of ISDN (integrated services digital network) through parallel port connection. Without the adapter, data is transferred into the serial port and typically hits a bottleneck.</p>
<p>The adapter has a list price of $239 to $279.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
